Package: aitrail
Title: Document, Verify and Disclose the Use of AI in Research
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pablo", "Sánchez-Núñez", email = "psancheznunez@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7845-9506"))
Description: Keeps a structured, version-controlled record of how artificial
    intelligence tools are used in each phase of a research project
    (literature review, design, data collection and processing, analysis,
    interpretation, writing, figures, peer review and communication): which
    tools and model versions were used, for what, how much of their output
    was kept, and how people verified it. From that record it audits gaps in
    human oversight, checks that cited references exist and match their
    metadata in 'Crossref' <https://www.crossref.org/> and 'DataCite'
    <https://datacite.org/>, and generates AI-use disclosure statements in English and
    Spanish and a self-contained HTML report. Prompts are stored as hashes by
    default to protect unpublished and personal data. The package does not
    call any AI model and does not try to detect AI-generated text.
